-12th-january-evening-slot","exam":"jee-main","questions":[{"question_id":"ObonSAX7wcIhQ9FqwgIim","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2019 (Online) 12th January Evening Slot","year":2019,"subject":"physics","chapter":"rotational-motion","chapterGroup":"mechanics","type":"mcq","marks":4,"negMarks":1,"content":"The moment of inertia of a solid sphere, about an axis parallel to its diameter and at a distance of x from it, is 'I(x)'. Which one of the graphs represents the variation of I(x) with x correctly ?","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"<img src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/8SorO3AVmgaXVP0ro/UGDMlqmQNjXBWpuJj1mAnTMcCQHVS/FB1Isl3YsNJh7F43KgnwDj/image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;  height: auto;display: block;margin: 0 auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"JEE Main 2019 (Online) 12th January Evening Slot Physics - Rotational Motion Question 203 English Option 1\">"},{"identifier":"B","content":"<img src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/nw8Q7YSG22t5O1xHD/Mmu88lFVXbXjWI1551csBpKJO3OSU/h0JHOAi9lt9HbRGsu4XR5c/image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;  height: auto;display: block;margin: 0 auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"JEE Main 2019 (Online) 12th January Evening Slot Physics - Rotational Motion Question 203 English Option 2\">"},{"identifier":"C","content":"<img src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/wHG9xz0tEhBD7Wpaq/NBRoEiW862cSNNKAOZQf1Yt2VOaPB/folPiwrXbJI46h7k6AKIX7/image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;  height: auto;display: block;margin: 0 auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"JEE Main 2019 (Online) 12th January Evening Slot Physics - Rotational Motion Question 203 English Option 3\">"},{"identifier":"D","content":"<img src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/zRxpz5KAG2t6eZ4Bl/yDMavm5DjPuX3n7Whh5pRUCStOk5i/HKDotK6y7husNSTAKHVcue/image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;  height: auto;display: block;margin: 0 auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"JEE Main 2019 (Online) 12th January Evening Slot Physics - Rotational Motion Question 203 English Option 4\">"}],"correct_options":["C"],"explanation":"<p>